<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela bolivar closes flat in slow trade.</title>
<headline>Venezuela bolivar closes flat in slow trade.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Venezuelan bolivar closed flat at 470.50/471.75 bolivars per dollar in a slow session that saw no Central Bank intervention, traders said.</p>
<p>&quot;It was a quiet day, with turnover well under what we usually see,&quot; said one broker.</p>
<p>The market was little swayed by the modest two-basis point rise in six-month TEM yields at today's Central Bank auction, traders said.</p>
<p>-- Ana Isabel Martinez, Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600</p>
